WEBVTT

00:09:29.716 --> 00:09:31.081
half your life.

00:09:31.105 --> 00:09:34.921
Were you this sort of computer
genius, you know, übernerd,

00:09:34.945 --> 00:09:37.430
were you the star at school
who could do everything?

00:09:37.454 --> 00:09:38.986
What were you like as a kid?

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:42.623
LT: Yeah, I think I was
the prototypical nerd.

00:09:42.647 --> 00:09:43.916
I mean, I was ...

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:47.092
I was not a people person back then.

00:09:47.116 --> 00:09:49.696
That's my younger brother.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.507
I was clearly more interested
in the Rubik's Cube

00:09:52.531 --> 00:09:54.056
than my younger brother.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.167
(Laughter)

00:09:55.191 --> 00:09:58.311
My younger sister,
who's not in the picture,

00:09:58.335 --> 00:10:00.749
when we had family meetings --